concept is not a binding condition. A binding condition would need to bind something to something — a condition that, when parsed, licenses continuation. The user named the concept but supplied no condition. So the condition is absent. Non-empty output destroys validity. Hence: empty output.\n\nMy response should be empty. I'll output nothing."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":150,"completion_tokens":808,"total_tokens":958,"cached_tokens":150,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":793},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":150}}}